# Root ignore rules for the MarketLens monorepo.
#
# Storage policy
# --------------
# The *tracked* repository is intentionally tiny (< 1 MB). Everything that
# can be regenerated locally is ignored:
#   * node_modules / .next / build output
#   * Python bytecode, virtualenvs and the QuantLab HTTP cache
#   * Notebook checkpoints and executed-notebook outputs
#
# Run `bash scripts/clean.sh` to reclaim disk space at any time.

# ── Node / Next.js ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── QuantLab HTTP cache (regenerate on demand, ~10–40 MB) ───────────────────
project/ml/.cache/

# ── Jupyter ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/
project/ml/notebooks/outputs/

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# ── Docs (kept outside the repo, never committed) ───────────────────────────
marketlens_docs/
docs-outside/

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
